{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048678 :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138428 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138083 :question/math-academy-id "e-13129" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=8 \\\\ 2x-y &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram below to determine this system's solution $(x,y)$.\n\n![](images/6f/6f0b7960b9b4c98250741b009da2ad19c1123c5b7adf9cd5072430fb9a879dc9.png)" :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines. \n\n![](images/5c/5c1c69adc880ea7cfdb5a4e0a10abd6032d2eedf0386923b94df9b7c173edd6d.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(4,2).$ Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(4,2).$"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138700 :question/math-academy-id "q-171700" :question/problem "![](images/af/af8654d3581e41e1d206494fc3e6f0f2d1a9471285c0d9c856484ac966cbdc51.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + y &=1 \\\\ 2x + y &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138764 :question/math-academy-id "q-238014" :question/problem "![](images/70/7035e6e365263cddf659554a40093d9661a140754d4c195791fd266c9389c3da.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x - y &=12 \\\\ y &=-3x + 9\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495121 :question/math-academy-id "q-238005" :question/problem "![](images/49/495f9509b35049e62f7f67f8fac64378f5abf77fcef19afe2694b6f774b57b8d.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y &=2x+1 \\\\ x+y &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x,y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$\\,($\n{{field-1}}\n$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines. \n\n![](images/81/8137f53c1e125e3fed67683948f623bbb359a302b6e761cc86f1ccb63f8e9486.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(-2,-3).$ Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(-2,-3).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495142 :question/math-academy-id "q-238028" :question/problem "![](images/02/02ea40d2c1f7b8fc1d5b82a2d04f2f21a6adb0a88fa73e7dc42cbe6664f0c662.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5x+y &=-20 \\\\ x-y &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x,y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$\\,($\n{{field-1}}\n$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines. \n\n![](images/f8/f85c4c0066a850e75910aa3a9fa4330e7c68705e7b19a3e7d1d180cb4052db36.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(-4,0).$ Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(-4,0).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497596 :question/problem "![](images/57/57f26fa567d4b5f6168028384fd3a5d0540ce312bb0d8abf62e61f129a4d6292.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}4x - y = -8\\\\y =3x + 7\\end{array}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$." :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines.\n\n![](images/d0/d06f39a6601cde150aeffa786f4c02fb36b0c467a5570117ca54c37f7c683937.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(-1,4)$. Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(-1,4)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497597 :question/problem "![](images/07/071d8658d449a44bb58f9fd4fa0ac2e9d882f2302ede815858afdb9cd7b1dbfd.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x + y = 5\\\\y =2x - 1\\end{array}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$." :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines.\n\n![](images/e3/e3bfc8e3de7b53fa8fabe7154b336577901f7ce7f1996a5bb172e95caadac031.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(2,3)$. Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(2,3)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497598 :question/problem "![](images/68/68e699b9fbf3ce6e9a1c796d3273ea153cc26b73fdb81970281321b24eeb1663.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}4x + y = -17\\\\x - y = -3\\end{array}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$." :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines.\n\n![](images/7d/7d830827272ecec1f24e070efb07e29bb964d0fcb38b4bb5bb5f0ccac50a8839.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(-4,-1)$. Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(-4,-1)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497599 :question/problem "![](images/de/dec0eafaa1fd6aee840ab401890850b2bf59debf8a52281b2e77eba875a91d89.png)\n\nConsider the following system of equations:\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x + y = 8\\\\x - y = 0\\end{array}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the diagram provided to determine the solution $(x, y)$ of this system.\n\nThe solution is\n$($ {{field-1}} $,$ {{field-2}} $)$." :question/worked-solution "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines.\n\n![](images/3d/3d09e17de64a074d4a1a4263a4189e8456908356314ca387ffea278cc511b738.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(4,4)$. Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(4,4)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 175921864